WEBVTT

00:03.810 --> 00:07.730
<b>The Fruit of Evolution 2:</b>

00:03.810 --> 00:07.730
<b>The Fruit of Evolution 2:</b>

00:04.890 --> 00:07.730
<b>Before I Knew It, My Life Had It Made</b>

00:04.890 --> 00:07.730
<b>Before I Knew It, My Life Had It Made</b>

00:04.890 --> 00:07.730
<b>Before I Knew It, My Life Had It Made</b>

01:30.520 --> 01:35.530
<b>The Four Leaders Closing In</b>

01:37.810 --> 01:43.890
Louise, I want you to go and bring Seiichi 
here for the forging of our alliance.

01:44.200 --> 01:46.370
Bring Master here?

01:46.370 --> 01:47.410
Yes.

01:48.260 --> 01:51.350
Demons and humans are forging an alliance.

01:51.350 --> 01:54.760
It would be best if Seiichi 
were present for the summit.

01:55.720 --> 01:57.100
As you command.

01:57.870 --> 01:58.980
I'm counting on you.

02:05.050 --> 02:09.110
<i>Louise headed to the Magic 
Academy on Ranze's orders.</i>

02:09.940 --> 02:14.410
<i>She had no issue retrieving Seiichi to 
act as a witness, along with Saria, but...</i>

02:16.590 --> 02:21.910
<i>What on earth happened to Louise, 
the kingdom's strongest warrior?!</i>

02:21.910 --> 02:24.660
<i>What fate lies in store for the world?</i>

02:36.850 --> 02:40.890
We will now begin the guild's 
new recruit audition!

02:41.140 --> 02:43.330
We're going to recruit talented individuals

02:43.330 --> 02:46.140
as we head into the alliance 
with the Demon Lord Army!

02:46.140 --> 02:49.670
Who's da baby dat can make me moan?!

02:49.670 --> 02:52.210
Let's get this party started!

02:55.100 --> 02:56.040
Number 1!

02:58.310 --> 02:59.530
My!

03:00.580 --> 03:02.660
A hot guy from the start!

03:02.660 --> 03:04.410
So titillating!

03:02.660 --> 03:06.540
<b>Buff Buff</b>

03:04.410 --> 03:07.580
You're so ripped and puffy!

03:08.410 --> 03:10.140
<b>Buff Buff</b>

03:08.410 --> 03:10.830
Huh?!

03:10.830 --> 03:13.490
Oh! He's flying away!

03:15.010 --> 03:16.790
Number 12...

03:18.790 --> 03:21.050
Thanks!

03:21.050 --> 03:24.100
He's huge, he's weawing bunny ears, 
and he has too many ewements!

03:24.100 --> 03:25.540
Wejected!

03:28.440 --> 03:29.940
I'm number 16!

03:29.940 --> 03:30.940
Everyone knows my face—

03:30.940 --> 03:32.540
Yeah, rejected!

03:35.570 --> 03:37.020
Rejected!

03:38.780 --> 03:40.280
We're—

03:40.280 --> 03:40.920
The Big—

03:40.920 --> 03:41.990
Rejected!

03:41.990 --> 03:44.850
Oh, every single one of them!

03:46.460 --> 03:49.160
No! Wh-Who are you?!

03:50.120 --> 03:55.080
I'll be winning this audition.

03:55.080 --> 03:56.930
Quite da baby we haf here!

03:56.930 --> 03:59.820
Will you entawtain me?!

04:00.210 --> 04:06.640
Milky white, with a tinge of green 
and an appealing smell of custard...

04:06.640 --> 04:08.510
<b>Gulp Gulp</b>

04:08.510 --> 04:11.640
Such thorough consideration for 
the temperature and freshness...

04:12.870 --> 04:17.190
It's truly the finest drink, 
packed full of a mother's love for her child.

04:18.200 --> 04:20.150
You're not bad.

04:20.770 --> 04:23.610
Can you keep up with my hip thrusts?!

04:25.570 --> 04:26.810
Very well.

04:27.820 --> 04:29.950
Too slow! Too slow! Too slow!

04:29.950 --> 04:31.950
Try thrusting harder!

04:32.200 --> 04:34.820
No, you're wrong! Look closer!

04:35.690 --> 04:37.080
Th-That's...

04:37.930 --> 04:39.920
It's just like a wheel!

04:39.920 --> 04:42.850
When it rotates too fast, 
it actually looks like it's stopped,

04:42.850 --> 04:45.020
and that man's thrusting his 
hips too fast to follow,

04:45.020 --> 04:48.010
so it looks like he's going slower!

04:48.010 --> 04:50.180
Wh-What did you say?!

04:55.340 --> 04:57.310
What a hottie!

04:57.310 --> 04:58.730
Yes!

04:59.370 --> 05:03.690
Looks like we finally have someone 
who can excite our pathos.

05:04.700 --> 05:08.120
Let me see what you're capable of!

05:08.120 --> 05:10.300
Yes, of course.

05:11.290 --> 05:12.860
P-Pardon me!

05:14.570 --> 05:15.830
Th-This is...

05:16.530 --> 05:19.810
At first glance, they looked like common 
trapezius muscles and deltoids.

05:19.810 --> 05:23.880
However, this nice bulk has actually 
been refined to its limits!

05:23.880 --> 05:27.550
You must have spent many sleepless 
nights honing it to this degree.

05:28.300 --> 05:29.890
This is truly...

05:30.470 --> 05:32.930
Chomulungma!

05:34.060 --> 05:36.430
Then how about this?

05:38.850 --> 05:41.540
O-Ogre!

05:38.850 --> 05:47.030
<b>Ogre</b>

05:42.040 --> 05:44.870
It looks like the face of a ferocious ogre!

05:44.870 --> 05:47.030
Such wonderful molding!

05:47.460 --> 05:50.580
You win the Nobel Prize for Muscles!

05:50.910 --> 05:54.710
You get to be our new member!

05:58.310 --> 05:59.750
Congratulations.

06:01.090 --> 06:02.710
Congratulations.

06:02.710 --> 06:04.880
Congwatulations.

06:05.620 --> 06:06.630
Congratulations.

06:11.460 --> 06:12.590
Thank you.

06:20.500 --> 06:22.020
Oh, no!

06:22.020 --> 06:25.280
It's already time for the summit to start!

06:25.510 --> 06:26.750
Now, everyone!

06:26.750 --> 06:32.000
It's time for our rock-solid guild 
to welcome the Demon Kingdom!

06:32.000 --> 06:33.630
Yeah!

07:37.500 --> 07:41.010
Thank you for coming here today, Lutia-dono.

07:41.790 --> 07:44.370
Thank you for the grand welcome.

07:45.500 --> 07:47.850
<i>How is it going?</i>

07:49.320 --> 07:51.900
All's going as planned.

07:53.740 --> 07:56.990
Those idiots are wasting their time.

08:37.140 --> 08:38.390
<i>Emperor Alf...</i>

08:40.020 --> 08:43.530
<i>Where is this nation heading now?</i>

08:46.580 --> 08:47.990
<i>I'm so ashamed.</i>

08:48.370 --> 08:53.810
<i>Is there nothing I can do other than 
be a puppet in service to this country?</i>

09:04.050 --> 09:07.930
The Kaiser Empire basically belongs 
to the Great Devil Order now.

09:07.930 --> 09:13.740
We keep gathering negative energy, from the 
royal family all the way to its commoners.

09:15.500 --> 09:17.790
<i>You're so evil, too!</i>

09:17.790 --> 09:21.230
Now we just need to revive the Great Devil...

09:21.570 --> 09:24.250
<i>And world domination will be ours!</i>

09:25.590 --> 09:27.500
Is what you just said true?!

09:29.150 --> 09:31.040
The Emperor's Sword, Zakia!

09:32.420 --> 09:35.470
Eavesdropping is a bad habit.

09:35.470 --> 09:36.500
Silence!

09:36.500 --> 09:39.250
Was this your plan from the beginning?!

09:41.870 --> 09:47.700
Are you still adhering to the 
previous emperor Alf's drivel?

09:48.530 --> 09:50.360
<i>Drivel, he says?</i>

09:50.760 --> 09:56.900
This world is filled with people crying, 
screaming, and begging for salvation.

09:56.900 --> 10:02.520
And that despair will feed 
the Great Devil's revival!

10:03.450 --> 10:05.180
I won't allow it!

10:07.080 --> 10:09.120
On my name as the Emperor's Sword!

10:12.960 --> 10:15.550
You're still not good enough.

10:16.880 --> 10:21.220
No one can stop this plan.

10:30.110 --> 10:32.110
Zakia.

10:33.110 --> 10:37.530
About 20 or 30 years ago...

10:37.960 --> 10:41.880
A nation was suddenly attacked by monsters.

10:42.420 --> 10:45.130
Everything was burnt down,

10:45.130 --> 10:49.090
and while I fought back,
I was no match for them at all.

10:49.420 --> 10:51.460
Even you weren't, Emperor Alf?

10:52.630 --> 10:59.130
I created this nation to prevent 
that from ever happening again.

10:59.770 --> 11:00.650
Yet...

11:02.810 --> 11:05.390
Look at the state it's in now.

11:06.180 --> 11:07.810
Zakia...

11:09.570 --> 11:14.060
If this nation is ever 
beset by such a crisis,

11:14.500 --> 11:19.700
would you please rise 
up and save this nation?

11:21.020 --> 11:25.770
If that time ever comes, you'll 
need to work with other nations

11:25.770 --> 11:29.230
and lead this country yourself.

11:30.290 --> 11:32.120
Please.

11:34.790 --> 11:37.290
<i>Emperor, I...</i>

11:38.260 --> 11:40.620
<i>I will honor your wishes!</i>

11:52.570 --> 11:53.510
<i>There it is!</i>

11:57.230 --> 11:58.690
Who are you?!

11:59.620 --> 12:03.110
Where are you going in such a hurry,

12:03.900 --> 12:06.470
Knight Captain Zakia-san?

12:07.450 --> 12:09.290
You know who I am?

12:09.290 --> 12:11.480
If you stand in my way, 
I will show no mercy.

12:11.480 --> 12:14.540
The world will be plunged into chaos.

12:16.620 --> 12:18.370
Doesn't that sound like fun?

12:21.310 --> 12:22.630
Over here.

12:25.540 --> 12:28.150
Are you with the Great Devil Order?

12:28.920 --> 12:30.810
That's right!

12:47.200 --> 12:48.070
<i>Whoops.</i>

12:48.070 --> 12:49.070
<i>Now!</i>

12:52.330 --> 12:53.330
<i>What?!</i>

12:55.790 --> 12:57.140
You almost had me.

13:03.060 --> 13:05.090
<i>I can't stop shaking!</i>

13:08.790 --> 13:09.910
<i>What?</i>

13:12.930 --> 13:16.630
Now it's my turn.

13:30.940 --> 13:34.100
Wh-What are you after?

13:34.100 --> 13:36.520
Are you trying to destroy the world?!

13:41.210 --> 13:43.420
I'd say I just want to have fun.

13:51.590 --> 13:52.740
Though...

13:52.740 --> 13:55.010
I guess it's about time to end this.

13:59.960 --> 14:02.100
N-Not yet!

14:02.410 --> 14:04.150
I can't die yet!

14:04.460 --> 14:09.640
I'll never be able to face 
Emperor Alf if I die here!

14:30.030 --> 14:31.600
Oh, boy.

14:32.040 --> 14:35.180
You're hanging in there, but it's no use.

14:37.800 --> 14:39.980
Well? You scared?

14:40.850 --> 14:44.620
<i>Zakia, I entrust this sword to you.</i>

14:45.770 --> 14:47.020
Your Majesty...

14:47.880 --> 14:49.990
This is the proof of your reign!

14:51.190 --> 14:52.660
Zakia...

14:53.350 --> 14:57.580
From now on, you will declare 
yourself the Emperor's Sword, Zakia!

14:57.880 --> 15:00.670
Do not bring dishonor 
to that title in battle!

15:08.210 --> 15:09.090
I am...

15:10.850 --> 15:13.010
the Emperor's Sword, Zakia!

15:16.100 --> 15:17.850
I will see it through!

15:18.160 --> 15:22.850
On my title, I will fulfill 
the wish entrusted to me!

15:22.850 --> 15:24.770
Magic Gem Sword, Fiftia!

15:26.440 --> 15:27.610
Take this!

15:28.550 --> 15:30.200
Conquest Wave!

15:45.710 --> 15:49.790
I had my hopes up since you're 
captain of the knights,

15:50.290 --> 15:52.300
but you're a disappointment.

15:56.570 --> 15:57.740
Bye-bye.

16:04.820 --> 16:08.110
My name is Louise, captain of the Valkyries!

16:08.520 --> 16:10.990
Any who shed blood on our land

16:10.990 --> 16:13.260
will receive no mercy!

16:14.250 --> 16:16.290
Oh, is that so?

16:16.290 --> 16:17.870
Are you all right, Zakia?!

16:17.870 --> 16:20.170
R-Run away, Louise.

16:20.670 --> 16:21.540
That man is—

16:21.770 --> 16:22.960
We'll talk later.

16:23.480 --> 16:25.340
I'll take you on with my full might!

16:25.720 --> 16:27.430
You really shouldn't do that.

16:28.300 --> 16:29.340
Here I go!

16:44.480 --> 16:45.560
Louise!

16:47.350 --> 16:48.930
<i>H-He's strong!</i>

16:52.250 --> 16:53.830
See?

16:55.140 --> 16:56.580
E-Even so...

16:57.240 --> 16:59.740
You're not as strong as my master!

17:00.310 --> 17:01.510
Master?

17:04.570 --> 17:07.500
He could defeat you in an instant!

17:09.880 --> 17:11.980
That's enough, Louise!

17:11.980 --> 17:13.510
Get out of here!

17:14.050 --> 17:16.380
Don't be foolish!

17:17.820 --> 17:19.260
I like that look.

17:19.830 --> 17:20.760
No!

17:20.990 --> 17:23.430
Can you endure this?

17:30.630 --> 17:31.690
Zakia!

17:31.690 --> 17:32.870
Are you okay?!

17:32.870 --> 17:35.070
Zakia! Zakia!

17:49.750 --> 17:52.540
Zakia! Hang in there!

17:52.540 --> 17:54.250
I'll go get help!

17:54.250 --> 17:56.230
Hang in there!

18:03.510 --> 18:04.910
Louise...

18:06.120 --> 18:09.810
There's something I must tell you...

18:14.150 --> 18:15.630
The Great Devil Order?!

18:16.750 --> 18:18.130
Louise...

18:20.920 --> 18:25.010
I entrust the future to you...

18:26.750 --> 18:31.660
Don't die! Zakia!

18:36.450 --> 18:38.890
I see. So that's what happened...

18:39.850 --> 18:42.580
If the Great Devil Order is taking action,

18:42.580 --> 18:45.520
the alliance summit is 
most likely in danger.

18:45.520 --> 18:47.100
That's not true!

18:47.100 --> 18:52.410
After all, the Wimberg Kingdom has 
Ranze-san and everyone from the guild!

18:53.020 --> 18:54.010
Right?

19:02.580 --> 19:05.570
Let's make certain this alliance is forged.

19:07.410 --> 19:08.210
Yes!

19:29.520 --> 19:35.650
What did you mean by calling 
me a bearded bastard earlier?

19:35.650 --> 19:41.070
What about you, calling the underwear 
traditionally passed on in our guild vulgar?!

19:41.300 --> 19:44.030
This alliance is off!

19:44.030 --> 19:46.190
Bring out the rice with tea!

19:47.210 --> 19:48.580
Everyone, calm down!

19:49.320 --> 19:50.580
Lutia-sama!

19:50.580 --> 19:52.500
Hey! Cut it out a—

19:52.500 --> 19:53.590
King Ranze!

19:53.920 --> 19:56.130
Both of you, cut it out!

19:54.660 --> 19:56.960
Please, everyone! Calm down!

19:56.960 --> 19:59.300
Stop this!

20:00.980 --> 20:05.140
Every conflict starts out as just a tiny spark.

20:05.140 --> 20:07.710
Yet hatred only begets more hatred,

20:07.710 --> 20:09.780
doubling, tripling, 
becoming ten times greater,

20:09.780 --> 20:13.460
until eventually the entire 
world is enveloped in flames!

20:13.460 --> 20:16.900
We did not come here to fight.

20:16.900 --> 20:20.070
We came here to join hands!

20:20.070 --> 20:23.950
H-He's exactly right!

20:23.950 --> 20:25.790
Huh?!

20:26.280 --> 20:29.070
I'm sorry, Demon Lord Army!

20:29.070 --> 20:30.700
I'm sorry, too!

20:38.750 --> 20:40.410
Ah, wrong place.

20:40.410 --> 20:42.540
Oh! Seiichi!

20:43.430 --> 20:45.000
You're late!

20:45.000 --> 20:46.930
Uh, no! I'm not into that!

20:46.930 --> 20:47.800
Louise!

20:48.040 --> 20:49.620
What happened to you?

20:50.100 --> 20:53.140
King Ranze, the truth is...

20:54.660 --> 20:55.950
What?!

21:06.270 --> 21:07.710
Lutia-dono.

21:07.710 --> 21:11.740
This matter has grown bigger 
than our two nations.

21:12.380 --> 21:13.290
Yes.

21:13.290 --> 21:17.500
We can't let the Great Devil Order 
and the Kaiser Empire have their way.

21:18.010 --> 21:20.420
Let's protect this world together.

21:33.650 --> 21:37.980
<i>At last, the Wimberg Kingdom and the 
Demon Kingdom forge their alliance.</i>

21:38.900 --> 21:41.990
<i>However, the evil hand 
of the Great Devil Order</i>

21:41.990 --> 21:45.240
<i>is drawing closer with 
every passing moment...</i>

23:26.870 --> 23:28.820
Guess it's about time.

23:30.380 --> 23:32.150
Continued in the next episode!

23:35.580 --> 23:38.250
One of the Great Devil Order's top 
four, Gempel the Doppelganger.

23:38.250 --> 23:40.480
He possesses an incredible power.

23:40.480 --> 23:41.960
Now the academy is in danger!

23:41.960 --> 23:43.950
As for what kind of danger...

23:43.950 --> 23:46.120
You'll find that out next time!

23:46.120 --> 23:47.900
Next time: "Gempel the Doppelganger."

23:46.400 --> 23:50.250
<b>Next Time
Gempel the Doppelganger</b>

23:47.900 --> 23:49.900
Wait, I'm already feeling 
lightheaded in the preview?!
